stem: "A pharmacist, Sarah, notices a distressed customer trying to purchase multiple large packs of paracetamol and ibuprofen. When Sarah explains the legal sales limits, the customer bursts into tears, stating, 'It doesn't matter anyway, nothing is working, I just want everything to stop.' The pharmacy is currently busy with a long queue of customers waiting for prescriptions.",
