stem: "An FY2 doctor, Dr Patel, is reviewing a 72-year-old patient, Ronald, who was admitted with an acute exacerbation of COPD and is now medically fit for discharge. Ronald lives alone, has chronic mobility issues, and has no formal social care package. Dr Patel notices that Ronald has extremely poor personal hygiene, unkempt clothing, and has lost significant weight since his last admission three months ago. Ronald insists he is 'managing perfectly fine' and demands to go home immediately without any community referrals, stating he refuses to have strangers coming into his house.",
