title: "Vulnerable teenager threatening to run away",
setting: "GP surgery",
stem: "A 15-year-old girl, Chloe, attends a GP surgery alone, requesting emergency contraception. During the consultation, she breaks down in tears and reveals that her mother's new boyfriend regularly locks her in her bedroom overnight without access to food or the toilet. Chloe states she plans to run away from home tonight and sleep rough on the streets to escape him, begging the GP not to contact her mother.",
