stem: "You are an FY2 doctor taking over care of a patient in the Clinical Decision Unit. The outgoing doctor hands him over as 'a known frequent flyer with borderline personality disorder who is acting up and complaining of severe abdominal pain because she wants a side room.' Intrigued by the description, you review her chart and find her heart rate is 115 bpm, her temperature is 38.2°C, and no abdominal examination has been documented today.",
