explanation: "This is a very appropriate action because it prevents a potentially fatal medication error while seeking expert senior guidance to clarify the clinical intent. An FY1 must never prescribe a dose they know or suspect to be unsafe, even if copy-signing a senior's previous note. Active verification using trusted resources and immediate escalation is the standard of care."
