setting: "ward",
stem: "You are an FY1 doctor covering the surgical wards overnight. A nurse asks you to review a 45-year-old man who underwent a total abdominal colectomy six hours ago. His blood pressure has steadily dropped from 120/80 mmHg to 85/50 mmHg over the last hour, and his heart rate has risen to 115 beats per minute. He appears pale and clammy. His surgical drain has put out 400ml of frank blood since your shift started.",
